{
    "title": "Red & Blue Adventure",
    "description": "Red & Blue Adventure is here! Follow the adventure of the red and blue character and get through the intriguing challenges waiting for you.\r\n\r\nHelp the red and blue character reach their goal by simultaneously control them to get over the dangerous traps to get the key and complete the level. Each one will be different and harder than the last, so use your brain wisely.\r\n\r\nHOW TO PLAY:\r\n- Use the joystick to move one character.\r\n- Press the switch button to switch to the other character.\r\n- Press the jump button to get over the obstacles.\r\n- Get to the key to open the door.\r\n- Watch them dance gleefully as they escape.\r\n\r\nNEW FEATURES:\r\n- Challenging level design.\r\n- Many colorful skins.\r\n- New exciting mechanics.\r\n- Unique art style.\r\n- Unlimited playtime.\r\n- Fun soundtracks.\r\n\r\nRed & Blue Adventure is the game to try! Play now!.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Red &amp; Blue Adventure is here! Follow the adventure of the red and blue character and get through the intriguing challenges waiting for you.<br><br>Help the red and blue character reach their goal by simultaneously control them to get over the dangerous traps to get the key and complete the level. Each one will be different and harder than the last, so use your brain wisely.<br><br>HOW TO PLAY:<br>- Use the joystick to move one character.<br>- Press the switch button to switch to the other character.<br>- Press the jump button to get over the obstacles.<br>- Get to the key to open the door.<br>- Watch them dance gleefully as they escape.<br><br>NEW FEATURES:<br>- Challenging level design.<br>- Many colorful skins.<br>- New exciting mechanics.<br>- Unique art style.<br>- Unlimited playtime.<br>- Fun soundtracks.<br><br>Red &amp; Blue Adventure is the game to try! Play now!.",
